@startuml SD_Product_Browse
!theme cerulean-outline

title Product Browse Flow\nAdventureWorks Sales BI Platform

autonumber "<b>[0]"
hide footbox

skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #FAFAFA80
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam sequenceDividerBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #90A4AE

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor #37474F
    FontColor #212121
}
skinparam boundary {
    BackgroundColor #BBDEFB
    BorderColor #1565C0
    FontColor #0D47A1
}
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #E8EAF6
    BorderColor #3949AB
    FontColor #1A237E
}
skinparam control {
    BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    FontColor #1B5E20
}
skinparam entity {
    BackgroundColor #FFE0B2
    BorderColor #E65100
    FontColor #BF360C
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #F8BBD0
    BorderColor #AD1457
    FontColor #880E4F
}

box "Client Tier" #EBF5FB
    actor       "User"                                        as User
    boundary    "Browser / React\n(Products Page)"            as React
end box

box "Transport" #F9FBE7
    participant "Axios\napiClient"                            as Axios
end box

box "Backend" #F1F8E9
    control     "CategoriesController\n[AllowAnonymous]"      as CatCtrl
    control     "ProductsController\n[AllowAnonymous]"        as ProdCtrl
    entity      "ProductRepository"                           as Repo
end box

box "Data Layer" #FFF3E0
    database    "OltpDbContext\n(SQL Server\nAdventureWorks2019)" as DB
end box

== Page Load ==

User -> React : Navigates to /products
React -> React : useEffect triggers\ndata fetch on mount

React -> Axios : CatalogService.getCategories()
activate Axios
Axios -> CatCtrl : **GET /api/categories**
deactivate Axios
activate CatCtrl
CatCtrl -> DB : _db.Categories\n.AsNoTracking()\n.OrderBy(c => c.Name)
activate DB
DB --> CatCtrl : Category[]
deactivate DB
CatCtrl --> Axios : **200 OK** Category[]
deactivate CatCtrl
activate Axios
Axios --> React : categories
deactivate Axios

React -> Axios : CatalogService.getProducts()
activate Axios
Axios -> ProdCtrl : **GET /api/products**
deactivate Axios
activate ProdCtrl

ProdCtrl -> Repo : _repo.GetAllAsync()
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : _db.Products\n  .Include(x => x.Category)\n  .Include(x => x.SubCategory)\n  .AsNoTracking()\n  .OrderBy(x => x.Name)
activate DB
DB --> Repo : List<Product>
deactivate DB
Repo --> ProdCtrl : List<Product>
deactivate Repo

ProdCtrl -> ProdCtrl : Map to ProductDto[]\n(Id, Sku, Name, Description,\n Price, StockQty, ImageFileName,\n CategoryId, CategoryName,\n SubCategoryId, SubCategoryName)

ProdCtrl --> Axios : **200 OK**\nProductDto[]
deactivate ProdCtrl
activate Axios
Axios --> React : products[]
deactivate Axios

React -> React : Render product grid\nwith category filter sidebar

== Product Image Loading ==

loop For each product with ImageFileName
    React -> React : CatalogService.imgUrl(filename)\n=> http://localhost:57241/images/product/{filename}
    React -> Axios : <img src={imgUrl} />
    activate Axios
    Axios -> ProdCtrl : **GET /images/product/{filename}**
    deactivate Axios
    activate ProdCtrl
    note over ProdCtrl
        StaticFiles middleware
        PhysicalFileProvider
        => C:\images\product\
    end note
    ProdCtrl --> Axios : Image binary (PNG/JPG)
    deactivate ProdCtrl
    activate Axios
    Axios --> React : Rendered product image
    deactivate Axios
end

== Category Filtering ==

User -> React : Selects a category\nfrom filter sidebar
activate React
React -> React : Filter products client-side\nby selected categoryId
React -> React : Re-render product grid\nshowing filtered results
React --> User : Filtered product list displayed
deactivate React

== Product Detail Navigation ==

User -> React : Clicks on a product card
activate React
React -> React : navigate(`/products/${id}`)
React -> Axios : CatalogService.getProduct(id)
deactivate React
activate Axios
Axios -> ProdCtrl : **GET /api/products/{id}**
deactivate Axios
activate ProdCtrl

ProdCtrl -> Repo : _repo.GetByIdAsync(id)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : _db.Products\n  .Include(Category)\n  .Include(SubCategory)\n  .FirstOrDefaultAsync(x => x.Id == id)
activate DB
DB --> Repo : Product | null
deactivate DB

alt Product not found
    Repo --> ProdCtrl : null
    deactivate Repo
    ProdCtrl --> Axios : **404 Not Found**
    deactivate ProdCtrl
    activate Axios
    Axios --> React : Error displayed
    deactivate Axios
else Product found
    Repo --> ProdCtrl : Product
    deactivate Repo
    ProdCtrl -> ProdCtrl : Map to ProductDto
    ProdCtrl --> Axios : **200 OK** ProductDto
    deactivate ProdCtrl
    activate Axios
    Axios --> React : product
    deactivate Axios
    activate React
    React --> User : Render ProductDetails page\nwith image, description,\nprice, stock, Add to Cart
    deactivate React
end

@enduml
